            "review_title": "Review at Liberty Central Nha Trang - The Bistro",
            "review_text": "KRM\nNewcastle upon Tyne, United Kingdom192 contributions\n0\nOkay food, abysmal service\nMar 2019 • Couples\nMy partner and I ate here for breakfast. It was 90,000 VND for breakfast and a drink. \n\nWe both ordered our food and drinks, and had to wait 20 minutes before we got our meals. My partners meal came out completely wrong, he ordered the french breakfast and got the American breakfast. I had the poached eggs breakfast, which was okay, it wasn’t very hot at all and neither was my partners. I just wondered how long it had been sat waiting to be brought to us. He accepted his incorrect order anyway because he couldn’t be bothered to wait any longer. \n\nWe then had to ask for our drinks, i ordered an Americano with a side of milk, and my partner ordered a fresh mango juice. We waited, i got my americano with no milk and my partner got an espresso (again not what he ordered) We advised we ordered a fresh mango juice, so they took away the espresso & came back to tell us they had ran out of mango’s. Surely they’d know this when we ordered 45 minutes ago? \n\nAll in all, i wouldn’t recommend coming here. I’m sure theres other places that don’t get your order wrong three times and don’t bring out luke warm food.\nRead more\nWritten March 20, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
